{'symbol': 'MKC', 'date': '2022-09-29 16:20:00', 'title': 'MCCORMICK DECLARES $0.37 QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'HUNT VALLEY, MD. , SEPT. 29, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF MCCORMICK & COMPANY, INCORPORATED (NYSE: MKC) DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.37 PER SHARE ON ITS COMMON STOCKS, PAYABLE OCTOBER 25, 2022 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD OCTOBER 11, 2022.'}